		(property "Note" "Grounded source, which is what TPS40210-Q1 requires. LOGIC-LEVEL is not optional: at the 6 V cranking dip VDD is 5.7 V and the part's internal 8 V regulator is in dropout, so the gate gets about 5.7 V, not 8 V. Rds(on) must be specified at Vgs = 4.5 V."
